      "releaseNotes": "New in 1.3:\n• Meet your guide: pick its colours and eyes, give it a name, and it shows you around.\n• A clearer Milky Way chart, with My location and new Australian dark-sky places.\n• Frame shows real people at true scale.\n• Cleaner screens: explanations sit behind a ? until you want them.",
